# Hugging Face Space used for hairstyle edits (instruction-edit model).
# Chosen: FLUX.1 Kontext Dev. Verified anonymously on 1 portrait (bald, rasta: face kept well);
# skin fade + 2nd portrait NOT verified (anonymous ZeroGPU quota exhausted) -
# unverified beyond that: test with a real selfie and HF token.
# Endpoint params (view_api): /infer(input_image, prompt, seed, randomize_seed, guidance_scale, steps)
HF_SPACE=black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-Kontext-Dev
